/* 

  IQ best in Picat.

  Probability that the best male IQ is better than the best female IQ,
  given that 
  - male IQ is normal 100 15 
  - female IQ is normal 100 10

  Cf 
  - ppl_spread_of_traits.pi
  - my Gamble model gamble_iq_best.rkt

  This program was created by Hakan Kjellerstrand, hakank@gmail.com
  See also my Picat page: http://www.hakank.org/picat/

*/

import ppl_distributions, ppl_utils.
import util.
% import ordset.

main => go.

